this is a folder for "State Machine Data":
    keyed as "B-tov-data"
    named "data"
    following "3-Block Folder Structure"

this folder classifies as:
    tov (0) because "runtime data storage — persistent state between sessions"

this folder derives from:
    branch (0) from "bereshit/tov/" as "tov"

core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "And the LORD God formed man of the dust of the ground, and breathed into his nostrils the breath of life"
            from Genesis 2:7 in KJV
        principle "The body stores what the mind generates — persistent state across sessions"
        anchor "In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God"
            from John 1:1 in KJV

    serves as Body:
        role "Persistent storage for Claude Code state machine"
        paradigm "Body/Mind/Spirit — this is the Body layer"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-10
        version a-01.00
        modified 2026-01-01 for "Initial root.omni creation"

    exists to:
        purpose "Store persistent state, logs, configuration for CPI-SI state machine"
        design "Three-domain structure: db, logs, system"
        philosophy "The body that persists — what the mind learns, the body remembers"
        features:
            "SQLite database (cpisi.db) for queryable state"
            "Runtime logs for cognitive tracking"
            "System configuration and temporal patterns"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/tov/" for "containment in tov exit gate"
        includes (0) "word/work/pkg/, claude-global/hooks/" for "state machine integration"
        excludes (-1) "source code, specifications" because "data only, not definitions"
        used by "Claude Code hooks, session management, state tracking"
        integrates with "claude-global Go packages, libtrit"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/tov/data/" for "entering state machine storage"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing data domains"
        exits tov (0) for "runtime data found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "data folder is storage, not blocking"
        mitigation "validate data integrity through health checks"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "data storage healthy and accessible"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "data storage needs attention"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "data storage corrupted or inaccessible"

        operations:
            "db accessible" scores +20 (1) for "cpisi.db responds to queries"
            "logs current" scores +15 (1) for "recent session logs present"
            "temporal operational" scores +15 (1) for "temporal system tracking time"
            "db corrupted" scores -30 (-1) for "database queries fail"
            "logs missing" scores -15 (-1) for "expected logs absent"

        cascade multipliers:
            "session dependency" multiplies by 2.0 because "state machine depends on data"

